# Jak II: Jak's moves on foot seen from his eyes (0.1.1, the owner: "certain actions seem to clip in the eyes"), made by
# C:\JakQuest\sim\make_actions.sh. Into play as jak2_melee.sim, then from frame 4600, a picture every few frames through each:
# B (spin kick), X (punch), A twice (jump, double jump), the left trigger (crouch) and A (high jump), the left trigger
# and X (uppercut), the stick ahead with the left trigger and A (long jump), A then X in the air (the dive). Look
# for nothing of Jak open or filling the eyes. Run with JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1 JAKVR_BODY_TRACE=1.
